[=#mysqlhandshake]
= Handshake Protocol Version =

The //handshake// option sets which version of the initial handshake the !MySQL protocol module sends to clients.  It defaults to 10, which is what modern clients expect.  Set it to 9 only for clients older than !MySQL 4.1.  Any other number is treated as 9, except 0, which is the same as leaving it out, as is anything that isn't a number.  Modern clients can't connect when it is set to 9.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@parts/sqlrelay-mysqlfehandshake.conf@
}}}
}}}

